# NOITE's gym (4fsalgin) starts the real SALGIN, which loses: no key, the
# clock ends the round with the player behind (salgin-alone-lose.input).
# NOITE shows itself, adds -1000, takes a life (2 left) and goes back to
# the bar (4fbar).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fsalgin --ms 110000 --input tools/play/salgin-4fsalgin-lose.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fsalgin --ms 125000 --fix all --input tools/play/salgin-4fsalgin-lose.input
#
# SALGIN starts at 10233; mane.WAV's end closes it near 105 s (the
# Corrigida's fair fight: near 114 s, below).
# The Corrigida (`--fix all`) shows SALGIN's controls screen first; Enter takes
# it down 50 ms after it opened, PORRADA stands for 2 s (the frozen intro,
# `fight_controls.start_delay_ms`) and the round then plays as the
# Original's from its start, 2050 ms later (`delay`: every later line
# moves too).
10283 ?fight_controls_screen key return
10283 ?fight_controls_screen delay 2050
12000 dump fight
# The Corrigida's fight (`fight_fair`, `fight_easy_ai`) ends later: SALGIN closes near 114 s.
0 ?fight_fair delay 9000
108000 result lost -1000
108000 expect 4fbar
108000 state
